@startuml
scale max 1920 width
top to bottom direction
!pragma layout smetana

title MedBuddy System Overview

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam packageFontColor #0F172A
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 14
  BorderThickness 2
  FontColor #0F172A
}

actor Patient as Patient
actor Caregiver as Caregiver

rectangle "Flutter Frontend\n\nMobile UI and device services" as Frontend #E8F4FF
rectangle "FastAPI Backend\n\nBusiness rules and secured APIs" as Backend #EAF8F0
database "PostgreSQL / SQLite\nApplication Data" as Database #F8FAFC
cloud "External Services\n\nFirebase, MFDS, Gemini\n약국·공휴일 API, Naver 지도" as External #FFF7E6

Patient --> Frontend : uses
Caregiver --> Frontend : uses
Patient -[hidden]right-> Caregiver
Frontend --> Backend : authenticated HTTPS API / WebSocket
Frontend --> External : 앱 인증·지도 SDK
Backend --> Database : persists and queries
Backend --> External : verifies and enriches
Database -[hidden]right-> External
External --> Frontend : push notifications

legend bottom
  Main presentation view: responsibilities and communication boundaries only
  채팅 기록은 Application Database, 연결 Registry는 프로세스 메모리에 저장한다.
  Redis는 Cache·요청 제한 Counter이며 채팅 방송 broker가 아니다.
endlegend
@enduml
